    "answer": {
      "short": "$(3x-y)(x+2y)$\n\nMatch the cross terms to $5xy$.",
      "worked": "The cross terms are $6xy-xy=5xy$, and $(-y)(2y)=-2y^2$.\n$$3x^2+5xy-2y^2=(3x-y)(x+2y).$$",
